  - 'Not built yet. Here will be The last champion''s bough on the every weapon''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Light from its god opens it and gives The Champion''s Arms (his own version of every weapon). Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. The last champion is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
